    # emily "Sorry about that!"
    emily "抱歉！"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:154
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_8e093b19:

    # emily "Seems your parents want us to jump right in!"
    emily "看来你的父母希望我们立即开始！"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:157
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_0ea4e765:

    # emily "They're pretty insistent that we cover Taming right away."
    emily "他们坚持要我们立即讲解驯化的内容。"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:160
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_ee14cd86:

    # emily "Looks like you've already got some stuff written down..."
    emily "看来你已经写下了一些东西......"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:163
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_a3b66b4e:

    # emily "Feel free to use it like a cheat sheet, alright?"
    emily "请随时把它作为备忘录来用，好吗？"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:166
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_16e3a16d:

    # emily "Okay, first things first—"
    emily "好吧，首先要说明的就是——"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:167
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_631357ef:

    # emily "Let's talk about what exactly Taming is."
    emily "我们来谈谈驯化到底是什么。"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:171
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_5a9598fd:

    # emily "Would you say that Taming involves exchanging and comparing DNA between two beings?" nointeract
    emily "你会说驯化涉及到两个生物之间交换和比较 DNA 吗？" nointeract

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:174
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_6d61c7d4:

    # emily "That's correct! You're already off to a great start."
    emily "没错！你已经有了一个很好的开始。"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:178
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_098cdc72:

    # emily "Actually, the correct answer was 'yes.'"
    emily "事实上，正确的答案是“是”。"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:179
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_5b51a5f8:

    # emily "But keep in mind-"
    emily "但请记住——"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:181
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_44f242e7:

    # emily "Taming is a very intimate process, it requires skin-to-skin contact, either with a simple kiss or anything more."
    emily "驯化是一个非常亲密的过程，它需要皮肤与皮肤的接触，无论是简单的亲吻还是其他什么。"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:182
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_91e77001:

    # emily "Getting tamed has a different effect on everyone. But in simple terms, it intensifies your emotions. Good and bad."
    emily "被驯化对每个人都有不同的影响。但简单来说，它会强化你的情感, 无论好与坏。"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:185
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_bc3f2c70:

    # emily "Taming can't be done between just anyone though. There are very clear limits."
    emily "但驯化不能在任何人之间完成。有非常明确的限制。"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:189
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_4669eb2f:

    # emily "Do you think one human could tame another human?" nointeract
    emily "你认为一个人可以驯化另一个人吗？" nointeract

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:192
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_94155bf9:

    # emily "Actually, humans can't tame each other since they're the same species."
    emily "事实上，人类无法驯化彼此，因为他们是同一物种。"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:195
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_39e525f3:

    # emily "That's correct!"
    emily "没错！"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:198
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_806e4c5a:

    # emily "This rule helps keep society stable. It allows people to live normally within their own species."
    emily "这条规则有助于保持社会稳定。它使人们能够在自己的物种内正常生活。"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:201
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_034d0cd3:

    # emily "But it also causes fear and prejudice, often leading to many single-species nations, towns, and communities."
    emily "但它也会引起恐惧和偏见，常常导致许多单一物种的国家、城镇和社区的形成。"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:202
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_1e94e3a9:

    # emily "Taming is a lifelong bond, so in many cases, people's worries are justified."
    emily "驯化是一种终身的羁绊，所以很多时候，人们的担心也是有道理的。"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:205
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_0501067e:

    # emily "But there are two ways to break this bond."
    emily "但有两种方法可以打破这种羁绊。"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:206
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_16a50f04:

    # emily "One, of course, is the death of either party."
    emily "当然，其中之一就是任何一方的死亡。"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:209
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_e30bb5c5:

    # emily "The other way is for a stronger tamer to 'override' the existing bond."
    emily "另一种方法是让更强大的驯化者“推翻”现有的羁绊。"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:212
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_93efe445:

    # emily "Moving on."
    emily "继续说。"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:213
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_3ed24e4f:

    # emily "There's a way for a powerful tamer to tame multiple people at once."
    emily "有一种方法可以让强大的驯兽师同时驯化多人。"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:216
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_e3233e7b:

    # emily "Imagine there's someone who's tamed three others."
    emily "想象一下有人驯化了三个人。"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:217
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_504b6394:

    # emily "Now, if someone stronger comes along, and tames that tamer..."
    emily "现在，如果有更强大的人出现，驯化那个驯化者……"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:220
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_eb5f2609:

    # emily "Would they essentially be taming all four people?" nointeract
    emily "他们实际上在驯化所有四个人吗？" nointeract

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:223
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_81601fb4:

    # emily "That's right!"
    emily "没错！"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:227
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_8118809a:

    # emily "Actually, they would."
    emily "事实上，他们会的。"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:230
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_c6c5c119:

    # emily "Tamed beings always display the strongest feelings towards whoever's at the top of the chain."
    emily "被驯化的生物总是对处于链条顶端的人表现出最强烈的感情。"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:231
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_676e2c97:

    # emily "It's one of the reasons why being a tamer isn't exactly a popular life path."
    emily "这就是为什么成为驯兽师并不完全是一种流行的生活方式的原因之一。"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:232
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_96a5fbf7:

    # emily "You're risking a lot every time you try to tame someone."
    emily "每次你试图驯化某人时，你都会冒很大的风险。"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:235
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_4f50525d:

    # emily "But it has its benefits. The more powerful beings you tame, the stronger you become!"
    emily "但它有它的好处。你驯化的生物越强，你就会变得越强！"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:238
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_b48750af:

    # emily "Knowing that, would you say both parties get stronger after taming?" nointeract
    emily "知道了这一点，你说驯化后双方都会变得更强吗？" nointeract

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:241
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_5a08b825:

    # emily "Exactly! And that's not all that happens!"
    emily "没错！而且发生的事情还不止这些！"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:245
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_c8231202:

    # emily "Actually, they both do! And that's not all that happens!"
    emily "实际上, 他们的确都会变强!而且发生的事情还不止这些！"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:248
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_79089b5f:

    # emily "While the tamer with the stronger soul wins, there are other qualities that exchange."
    emily "虽然拥有更强灵魂的驯化者获胜，但还有其他品质会互相交换。"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:249
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_e8564d45:

    # emily "For example, someone might have a better affinity for magic or the ability to learn new skills faster."
    emily "例如，某人可能对魔法有更好的亲和力或更快地学习新技能的能力。"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:250
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_f67b7214:

    # emily "This sharing of abilities makes taming beneficial for everyone involved."
    emily "这种能力的共享使得驯化对每个参与者都有好处。"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:253
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_97d167c2:

    # emily "And that's it—the basics of Taming!"
    emily "这就是驯化的基础知识！"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:254
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_d40e5fed:

    # emily "I hope you had as much fun as I did~"
    emily "希望你和我一样玩得开心~"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:258
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_90fd01a3_1:

    # emily "..."
    emily "..."

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:261
translate chinese_simp emily_teaching_b15e394f:

