    # think "Can't believe I'm about to see [emily] again. Only met her a few times, but she completely changed my life..."
    think "不敢相信我即将再次看到 [emily]。虽然只见过她几次，但她却彻底改变了我的生活……"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:311
translate chinese_simp train_ride_572f8e5c:

    # think "She was the only good thing about that place."
    think "她是那个地方唯一的美好的事物。"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:313
translate chinese_simp train_ride_c00bc5ed:

    # think "The closer I get, the more nervous I feel."
    think "越靠近她，我就越紧张。"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:314
translate chinese_simp train_ride_25df6cdd:

    # think "After so long... What do I even say to her... How do I properly thank her..."
    think "这么久了……我该对她说什么……我该怎么感谢她……"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:315
translate chinese_simp train_ride_91ad39a7:

    # think "I'll find a way to repay her, but first, I need to figure out what my parents did to me."
    think "我会想办法报答她的，但首先，我需要弄清楚我的父母对我做了什么。"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:316
