    # think "So this is where my parents lived... I guess owning a successful company does get you a mansion..."
    think "这就是我父母住的地方……看来拥有一家成功的公司确实能让你拥有一座豪宅……"

# game/scripts/intro.rpy:363
translate chinese_simp house_intro_2c5e05d5:

    # think "Well, [emily] said to just walk right in..."
    think "好吧，[emily] 说直接走进去......"

